   "ANSWER": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;,serif\">The Control Unit directs the operation of the processor by fetching, decoding, and coordinating the execution of instructions.</span></span></p>\n",
